# Dataset Information

This directory is intended for storing datasets and data-related documentation used in the HIV-1 drug-resistance machine learning project.

## Dataset Source

The project uses HIV-1 genotype–phenotype data that appears to correspond to the Stanford HIV Drug Resistance Database (HIVDB).

The original source and applicable usage permissions will be verified and documented.

## Dataset File

The original dataset is maintained locally during development and is not currently included in this public repository.

## Data Organization

- Original data: Preserved unchanged.
- Processed data: Generated during preprocessing.
- Analysis outputs: Stored separately from the original dataset.

## Important Note

Do not upload restricted datasets, sensitive information, or personally identifiable patient information.

All dataset use and redistribution must follow the applicable source terms and permissions.
